# Background textures for BackgroundReplacer (issue #10).
#
# Commit ONLY the tiny curated synthetic samples (sample_*.png) + the docs and
# generator. A real, varied photographic background set is large — like
# data/cache_crops/ and data/raw/, keep it local and never stage it. Anything a
# user drops in here (their own scenes) is ignored by default.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!generate_samples.py
!sample_*.png
